              <i class="fas fa-star me-2"></i>
              Welcome to Padma Giftz – Where Creativity Meets Craftsmanship!
            </h5>
            <div class="row">
              <div class="col-md-8">
                <p class="lead">Hi there!</p>
                <p>I'm <strong>Padmavathy V</strong>, the proud owner and creator behind Padma Giftz. As a woman entrepreneur, I'm passionate about bringing personalized, laser-engraved gifts to life. Every item I create is a reflection of my dedication to quality, craftsmanship, and customer satisfaction.</p>

                <p>What started as a simple idea – to make unique and meaningful gifts that leave a lasting impression – has now blossomed into a business that I'm incredibly proud of. I specialize in custom laser engraving on a variety of materials, from wood and acrylic to glass and leather.</p>

                <p>At Padma Giftz, I believe that every gift should tell a story. I take the time to ensure that each item is meticulously designed and engraved to perfection, creating not just a product, but an experience.</p>

                <p class="text-primary">
                  <i class="fas fa-heart me-2"></i>
                  Thank you for supporting my small business and for allowing me to bring a little bit of creativity and personal touch to your world.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card border-primary">
                  <div class="card-body text-center">
                    <i class="fas fa-award text-primary display-4 mb-3"></i>
                    <h6 class="card-title text-primary">Our Specialties</h6>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled small">
                      <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Custom Laser Engraving</li>
                      <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Wood & Acrylic Items</li>
                      <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Personalized Gifts</li>
                      <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Corporate Giveaways</li>
                    </ul>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
